# Game_Tabata — HIIT Interval Timer (ID 22)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_Tabata.h, Game_Tabata.cpp
# HTML: data/game_tabata_setup.html, game_tabata_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
HIIT timer alternating work/rest phases. Configurable durations, rounds or time limit.
Three sound modes: countdown beeps, single beep, silent.

## CONFIG
- activePucksCount, workTimeMs, restTimeMs
- soundMode: 0=countdown (3-2-1), 1=single beep, 2=silent
- limitMode: 0=rounds, 1=time limit
- limitValue → targetRounds or targetTimeMs

## STATES
TABATA_SETUP → TABATA_COUNTDOWN (3.1s, SKI) → TABATA_WORK ↔ TABATA_REST → TABATA_FINISHED
Optional: TABATA_PAUSED (freezes all timers)

## KEY MECHANICS
- EFF_PROGRESS during WORK: fill = timeLeft/workTimeMs, updates every 200ms
- Phase transitions: WORK→REST (increment round), REST→WORK
- Pause: stores pauseDuration, offsets all timestamps on resume
- 3-2-1 countdown beeps via warningStep counter (avoids repeats)
- No button interaction (pucks are passive indicators)

## COMMANDS
setup, cfg_pucks, cfg_work, cfg_rest, cfg_sound, cfg_lmode, cfg_lval, start, pause, stop, reset, exit

## STATUS JSON
{state, gT (global time), pT (phase time left), round, limitMode, targetRounds, targetTime, workTime, restTime}
